{# Carousel — "What's false?" Only when the Lies item names a specific,
   attributable claim with a documented correction. The claim never appears
   alone: it is labeled FALSE and the record follows on the same slide, so a
   cropped screenshot can't spread the claim. Styling follows the site's Lies
   card: coral-deep 6px rule, italic coral-deep question and label. #}
{% extends "_base.html.j2" %}
{% import "_macros.html.j2" as m with context %}
{% set f = story.false_claim %}
{% block css %}
.card { background: var(--cream-raised); border-top: var(--rule-lies); }
.top { position: absolute; left: 72px; right: 72px; top: 58px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
.kick { color: var(--ink-67); font-size: 20px; }
.q { position: absolute; left: 72px; top: 134px; font-size: 76px; line-height: 1; font-style: italic; color: var(--coral-deep); }
.lbl { position: absolute; left: 74px; top: 224px; font-size: 34px; font-style: italic; color: var(--coral-deep); }
.body { position: absolute; left: 72px; right: 72px; top: 320px; height: 840px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.1em; }
.blk { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.45em; }
.tag { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; font-family: var(--sans); font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-size: 0.5em; color: var(--ink-67); }
.stamp { border: 3px solid var(--coral-deep); color: var(--coral-deep); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 0.35em 0.6em 0.2em; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; }
.claim { border-left: var(--rule-lies); padding-left: 0.7em; font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--ink-72); }
.by { font-family: var(--sans); font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.55em; color: var(--ink-60); padding-left: 1.3em; }
.rec { border-left: var(--rule-truths); padding-left: 0.7em; font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--ink); }
.src { font-family: var(--sans); font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.55em; color: var(--ink-60); padding-left: 1.3em; }
.foot { position: absolute; left: 72px; right: 72px; bottom: 64px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
.addr { font-size: 24px; color: var(--ink); }
{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
<div class="top"><div class="kick kicker">The NTK Method</div>{{ m.counter('var(--ink-67)') }}</div>
<div class="q headline">What's false?</div>
<div class="lbl smallcaps">Lies</div>
<div class="body" data-fit="50,28">
  <div class="blk">
    <div class="tag"><span>The claim</span><span class="stamp">False</span></div>
    <div class="claim">{{ f.claim }}</div>
    <div class="by">{{ f.claimant }}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="blk">
    <div class="tag"><span>What the record shows</span></div>
    <div class="rec">{{ f.correction }}</div>
    <div class="src">{{ f.source }}</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="foot">{{ m.logo('ink', 48) }}<div class="addr url">{{ story.short_url }}</div></div>
{% endblock %}
